<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.25-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.25-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25-0.50 lower, instances 1.00 lower compared to Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade moderately active. Top $58.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     57.50-58.25</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     57.00-57.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     55.00-56.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     52.00-54.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to 50 higher on a thin test. Top 47.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs	47.00</p>
<p>	   500-700 lbs	47.50</p>
</text>
